2026-01-01 a lot cost, date and label
  a  2 X {3 EUR} [2026-01-02] (label)
  b  -2 X

2026-01-02 a total lot cost is reported per unit
  a  3 X {{10 EUR}}
  b  -3 X

2026-01-03 per unit, signed by the quantity
  a  -4 X {{10.0 EUR}}
  b  4 X

2026-01-04 a lot alone does not convert: the elided amount keeps the lot
  a  1 X {1 EUR}
  b

2026-01-05 a lot and a price: the price converts
  a  1 X {2 EUR} @ 3 EUR
  b

2026-01-06 empty and fixed lots
  a  1 X {}
  b  1 X {=2 EUR}
  c  -2 X
